## 3. Permitted Uses

Subject to the terms of this license, you may:

* Use the Software for personal, educational, research, and commercial internal purposes.
* Modify and extend the Software.
* Integrate or embed the Software into your own applications, platforms, or workflows.
* Use the Software in commercial products that are not primarily competing video editing platforms.
* Self-host the Software for internal use.
* Create plugins, integrations, extensions, or tooling around the Software.
* Distribute Derivative Works under this same license.
* Provide consulting, support, training, or integration services related to the Software.

